WEBVTT

00:25.900 --> 00:27.569
Do they kill Choi Mujin?

00:31.781 --> 00:32.782
No.

00:33.700 --> 00:35.035
He wasn't at the gym.

00:39.581 --> 00:41.833
No. We're doing fine.

00:43.001 --> 00:44.252
Thank you for checking.

00:58.099 --> 00:59.142
Ms. Kang.

00:59.225 --> 01:00.393
Hmm.

01:00.477 --> 01:02.145
Should we prepare ourselves?

01:02.228 --> 01:03.646
No, we should be fine.

01:04.230 --> 01:06.733
There's no official connection to the gym.

01:06.816 --> 01:07.817
Exactly.

01:10.070 --> 01:11.404
Don't give the cops anything.

01:11.488 --> 01:13.114
Make sure no one talks.

01:13.198 --> 01:14.240
Yes, sir.

01:19.662 --> 01:20.705
Did you check the cameras?

01:20.789 --> 01:21.956
They don't work.

01:22.582 --> 01:24.626
Bullshit. Look how many they've got.

01:25.835 --> 01:28.505
Of course, they don't work.
Gangs don't trust the police.

01:55.698 --> 01:59.119
- Is this the only camera here?
- It's the only one we have.

02:10.296 --> 02:12.841
Is this delivery truck
assigned to this area?

02:14.008 --> 02:15.426
Sir, if you hear anything,

02:15.510 --> 02:17.929
- would you mind giving me a call, please?
- I will.

02:35.822 --> 02:37.198
Let's try over there.

02:41.286 --> 02:43.371
None of the victims will talk.

02:44.831 --> 02:46.207
Who came back?

02:48.251 --> 02:49.377
Were you scared?

02:51.629 --> 02:52.881
Your first time?

02:55.091 --> 02:56.593
For me, it's been a while.

02:57.802 --> 03:00.138
Never seen anyone this ballsy before.

03:01.723 --> 03:03.808
DO NOT ENTER
UNDER INVESTIGATION

03:04.726 --> 03:06.186
We're cops.

03:06.269 --> 03:07.437
Don't be scared.

03:08.605 --> 03:09.814
I'm not scared.

03:11.065 --> 03:12.150
I'm sure you're not.

03:16.571 --> 03:17.572
Yeah?

03:20.700 --> 03:21.910
Yes, sir. Got it.

03:23.036 --> 03:24.829
Keep asking around. I gotta go.

03:40.428 --> 03:44.265
ARE YOU ALL RIGHT, SIR?

04:58.381 --> 04:59.340
Pildo.

05:00.174 --> 05:01.050
Move.

05:11.519 --> 05:12.687
We're in mourning.

05:13.271 --> 05:14.856
Mm-hm. We know.

05:15.982 --> 05:17.650
We're paying respects, punk.

05:20.778 --> 05:21.988
Move out of my way.

05:37.670 --> 05:38.921
One person.

05:42.425 --> 05:43.843
That's fine.

05:43.926 --> 05:45.970
We didn't bring an offering
for you, anyway.

05:50.600 --> 05:52.352
That must hurt, huh?

06:19.128 --> 06:20.296
I'd love a drink.

06:55.540 --> 06:57.291
Destiny of a dog…

06:58.709 --> 07:00.044
follows its owners.

07:02.046 --> 07:05.883
That dog can live in luxury
if it gets lucky with a rich owner,

07:06.717 --> 07:09.637
or it ends up dying out on the street.

07:10.888 --> 07:11.973
It's a dog's death.

07:14.934 --> 07:16.644
You cops are incredible, you know that?

07:18.396 --> 07:22.150
Even incompetent idiots like you
can manage become captain.

07:24.694 --> 07:27.530
You know you'd already be dead
if you were in our world.

07:35.621 --> 07:36.914
I'm sick of it, too.

07:38.624 --> 07:40.001
Let's end it, okay?

07:44.714 --> 07:46.632
How soon are you planning
on getting taken down?

07:50.845 --> 07:52.638
And why would I think of that?

08:01.314 --> 08:02.690
One thing I know.

08:07.904 --> 08:10.448
I'll never get caught
no matter what you do.

08:17.622 --> 08:18.831
Hey.

08:19.916 --> 08:21.751
What are you all doing here, huh?

08:22.668 --> 08:23.836
Here.

08:24.587 --> 08:26.756
Let me know if you ever wanna talk, huh?

08:28.299 --> 08:29.509
You wanna talk?

08:30.092 --> 08:31.552
Lots to say.

08:49.487 --> 08:51.572
Think long and hard, okay?

08:52.156 --> 08:54.075
Your man can't catch those guys.

08:56.369 --> 08:57.995
Detective, let's go.

08:59.205 --> 09:00.164
See you.

09:09.507 --> 09:11.384
Where is that stupid cunt hiding?

09:12.301 --> 09:13.761
Bored already.

09:13.844 --> 09:16.597
I'll let you have a taste when I get her.

09:17.223 --> 09:18.808
What the hell? Are you drunk?

09:19.350 --> 09:21.727
Ah! Sorry, man, I forgot.

09:21.811 --> 09:23.604
You can't fuck her anyway!

09:24.230 --> 09:25.690
You motherfucker!

09:26.941 --> 09:30.653
So let's catch her
and then we'll kill her.

09:33.781 --> 09:35.908
Why aren't we getting any buyers?

09:35.992 --> 09:37.702
We gave out plenty of stock!

09:39.412 --> 09:41.330
Should I call Mango?

09:43.207 --> 09:45.501
You think Mango is getting funny ideas?

09:48.921 --> 09:50.172
Yes!

09:58.389 --> 10:00.766
DONGCHEON’S CHOI MUJIN
STING OPERATION

10:00.850 --> 10:03.060
BALLISTICS FORENSICS ANALYSIS REQUEST

10:07.690 --> 10:08.858
Good work, sir.

10:09.775 --> 10:10.860
Find anything?

10:11.819 --> 10:12.653
Nothing.

10:12.737 --> 10:13.863
Sergeant Jeon!

10:14.405 --> 10:15.406
Hello.

10:16.407 --> 10:18.451
Shit. Search this.

10:19.285 --> 10:20.369
Any new leads?

10:20.870 --> 10:24.332
No witness, no video,
it's hard to identify anyone.

10:24.415 --> 10:27.376
Pildo. Who am I?

10:27.460 --> 10:28.586
Yeah.

10:32.214 --> 10:34.050
This is the kind of guy I am!

10:37.428 --> 10:38.929
Delivery truck's dashcam.

10:39.513 --> 10:41.641
I track down the driver in Seongan.

10:42.558 --> 10:43.559
Who is this?

10:43.643 --> 10:45.353
Looks familiar. We gotta look him up.

10:47.146 --> 10:48.397
Why are you here?

10:48.481 --> 10:49.690
You're a girl.

10:58.157 --> 11:00.076
Don't you think he looked
kind of familiar though?

11:01.786 --> 11:04.622
Do Gangjae,
this asshole was in Dongcheon.

11:04.705 --> 11:06.916
He disappeared four years ago.

11:06.999 --> 11:08.876
And, now, it looks like he's back.

11:09.794 --> 11:11.128
Did something happen?

11:11.796 --> 11:14.090
There is a rumor
that someone died in the gym.

11:17.093 --> 11:18.678
But what Choi Mujin do?

11:19.428 --> 11:22.306
He knows we're onto him,
so I'm guessing he'll lay low, right?

11:25.142 --> 11:26.477
He won't do that.

11:28.062 --> 11:31.315
Choi Mujin's… ego was damaged.

11:35.778 --> 11:37.279
Go find Gangjae.

11:38.030 --> 11:40.157
It's dangerous to make a move now.

11:43.994 --> 11:45.162
Are you scared?

11:46.706 --> 11:47.957
No, sir.

11:51.043 --> 11:53.879
If we don't fight back,
the organization crumbles.

11:56.006 --> 11:58.926
I have to show them what kind
of operation they're dealing with.

12:00.511 --> 12:01.804
Meet Dongcheon.

12:09.186 --> 12:11.105
First…

12:13.232 --> 12:14.233
let Mango go.

12:14.316 --> 12:15.317
- What?
- What?

12:15.985 --> 12:17.737
Let's see what Choi Mujin does.

12:18.863 --> 12:19.989
And Gangjae?

12:20.072 --> 12:21.532
Do we make an alert?

12:21.615 --> 12:23.075
You'll just let him be?

12:23.159 --> 12:25.619
No. Just observe it for the time being.

12:25.703 --> 12:28.164
We'll get Choi Mujin.

12:29.457 --> 12:30.916
We'll do it while he's still rattled.

12:32.626 --> 12:34.044
Four people died.

12:35.671 --> 12:38.215
If the two gangs collide, more will die.

12:38.299 --> 12:39.383
Do not care?

12:41.969 --> 12:44.180
Because they're still all human beings.

12:45.973 --> 12:47.475
Those assholes can die.

12:51.896 --> 12:54.064
Let's get Choi Mujin first.

13:12.416 --> 13:15.836
MANGO IS BEING RELEASED.
IT'S A TRAP.

13:43.906 --> 13:46.325
- The Musan branch is here.
- Get them ready.

13:51.288 --> 13:53.040
The other organizations are here.

13:53.123 --> 13:54.667
They are waiting your instructions.

13:58.754 --> 14:00.297
Send them all away.

14:02.341 --> 14:03.259
Sorry?

14:05.469 --> 14:06.846
Is there someone you trust?

14:08.889 --> 14:09.807
Yes.

14:11.225 --> 14:13.143
Cha Giho started a game,

14:15.563 --> 14:16.772
so I'll play too.

14:36.083 --> 14:37.835
Bets down, please.

14:40.671 --> 14:42.047
And you saved
the best for yourself.

14:42.131 --> 14:43.883
- You can have it.
- Gosh.

14:44.383 --> 14:45.593
- Hey.
- Hello, sir.

14:46.635 --> 14:47.553
Hey.

14:49.555 --> 14:51.390
Any word from the team on Dongcheon?

14:51.473 --> 14:52.892
They're quiet.

14:52.975 --> 14:55.185
The peons are going around
gathering intel,

14:55.269 --> 14:57.021
but they haven't found Do Gangjae.

14:57.104 --> 14:59.607
Maybe they're getting help
from other organizations?

15:00.441 --> 15:02.276
No.

15:02.359 --> 15:04.653
Choi Mujin will act personally.

15:08.699 --> 15:09.700
But…

15:13.704 --> 15:15.581
they may be crumbling from within.

15:15.664 --> 15:16.582
What?

15:18.292 --> 15:20.711
I think one of them will flip for us.

15:20.794 --> 15:21.837
What…

15:21.921 --> 15:23.130
Who?

15:23.213 --> 15:24.590
I don't know yet.

15:25.215 --> 15:26.717
I'll meet him later.

15:26.800 --> 15:27.843
Pildo.

15:28.469 --> 15:30.220
- Yeah.
- Later.

15:30.304 --> 15:33.557
What? When?
Where are you meeting him?

15:36.852 --> 15:39.271
What should we do
about Yamamoto?

15:39.855 --> 15:41.649
Have him wait for the time being.

15:41.732 --> 15:44.109
For building a new factory
and get new chemists,

15:44.193 --> 15:45.444
it'll take too much time.

15:45.527 --> 15:47.905
The buyers are nervous, too.

15:47.988 --> 15:49.573
Taeju, you deal with the buyers.

15:50.240 --> 15:51.241
Yes, sir.

15:51.867 --> 15:54.161
You said there's
a new drug circulating, right?

15:55.496 --> 15:56.997
I think it's Gangjae.

15:58.832 --> 16:01.502
He wants me dead
so that he can take our market.

16:03.003 --> 16:04.004
So…

16:05.673 --> 16:08.634
if we get him, we get his drugs.

16:11.136 --> 16:12.930
Yes, sir.

16:22.022 --> 16:24.274
A TRAITOR IS MEETING CHA GIHO.
I'LL LOOK INTO IT.

16:43.210 --> 16:44.795
It's hard for us to keep waiting.

16:44.878 --> 16:46.296
That's all I'm saying.

16:46.880 --> 16:49.008
And how long can we wait
without drugs?

16:49.717 --> 16:51.677
Gangjae's gang is a problem too.

16:52.219 --> 16:53.887
But even Narcotics is after you.

16:55.097 --> 16:57.307
Well, whose side do you think
we should take then?

16:58.017 --> 16:59.727
What if a war breaks out?

17:01.061 --> 17:02.146
Well…

17:03.105 --> 17:04.982
you'll place your bet on who wins?

17:13.032 --> 17:13.949
All right.

17:14.033 --> 17:15.242
Go ahead.

17:15.993 --> 17:17.786
Just be sure to remember.

17:19.038 --> 17:22.124
The buy-in… is your life.

17:36.388 --> 17:38.474
- Keep watching them.
- Yes, sir.

19:52.441 --> 19:54.234
You act like we've met before.

19:54.318 --> 19:55.444
Let me see your--

22:07.284 --> 22:08.243
So…

22:09.077 --> 22:11.747
Choi Mujin really did plant someone
among us.

22:13.373 --> 22:14.624
Pildo.

22:17.502 --> 22:19.379
Watch Oh Hyejin like a hawk.

22:20.380 --> 22:22.507
It feels like our intel has been leaking

22:23.091 --> 22:24.968
ever since she started with us.

22:25.510 --> 22:27.095
If she's their informant,

22:27.721 --> 22:30.140
and they removed the cameras
when she found them,

22:31.183 --> 22:33.143
why would they risk blowing her cover?

22:33.226 --> 22:35.062
What if they knew…

22:36.855 --> 22:38.482
exactly how we think?

22:42.611 --> 22:43.862
Let's go.

22:49.159 --> 22:50.160
Yes.

22:55.332 --> 22:56.750
It was a trap.

22:57.334 --> 22:59.336
Was Cha Giho trying to catch
my informant?

23:00.128 --> 23:01.296
Also…

23:03.215 --> 23:04.466
Jung Taeju was there.

23:18.021 --> 23:19.731
Don't do anything
for the time being.

23:20.315 --> 23:22.859
Cha Giho is waiting
for the organization to move.

23:25.445 --> 23:26.780
I'll find Gangjae.

23:33.870 --> 23:35.872
I've calmed down the buyers
for the time being.

23:45.382 --> 23:46.591
You may go.

23:50.595 --> 23:51.555
Yes, sir.

24:15.078 --> 24:17.372
I'LL TELL YOU WHERE GANGJAE IS
DONGMYO PARK 11 P.M.

24:25.964 --> 24:27.466
- Pildo.
- Yeah.

24:29.926 --> 24:31.595
It's Detective Oh's file.

24:32.637 --> 24:33.638
Sir.

24:35.182 --> 24:36.683
Why did you call out Taeju?

24:38.727 --> 24:40.687
He planted a spy among us,

24:41.438 --> 24:43.064
so I threw a stone on his way.

24:44.566 --> 24:46.943
Let's see how far the ripples will travel.

24:48.236 --> 24:49.154
Work hard.

24:49.738 --> 24:50.906
Good night, sir.

25:18.350 --> 25:21.478
PERSONNEL FILE

25:22.854 --> 25:25.106
PARENTS DECEASED
FATHER: OH JINYEONG

25:25.190 --> 25:30.695
THREW HIMSELF INTO ONCOMING TRAFFIC.
AUTOPSY REVEALS HE WAS USING METH.

25:38.119 --> 25:40.121
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY

26:29.045 --> 26:30.380
This is my knife.

26:31.089 --> 26:32.966
Kill him as soon as you find him.

26:49.941 --> 26:51.943
NATIONAL FORENSIC SERVICE

26:57.282 --> 26:59.034
I'm Oh Hyejin from Narcotics.

26:59.784 --> 27:01.286
Is the ballistic report ready?

27:01.369 --> 27:03.747
Yes. I just left a message
for your captain.

27:06.875 --> 27:09.085
Did you determine whose gun it was?

27:09.169 --> 27:12.631
We don't have access to that here.
But we restored the gun's serial number.

27:19.846 --> 27:23.058
SERIAL NUMBER IS GL86575

27:23.141 --> 27:27.062
PHOTO 4. RESTORED SERIAL NUMBER

27:52.796 --> 27:55.173
ADMINISTRATION DEPARTMENT

28:14.317 --> 28:17.612
- Choi Mujin left a gun at the crime scene.
- Why?

28:18.321 --> 28:19.989
Why now?

28:20.073 --> 28:22.367
He's probably trying to bait me

28:23.034 --> 28:25.286
since he thought it was a cop's gun.

28:31.918 --> 28:35.004
INCHANG METROPOLITAN POLICE AGENCY
GUN SERIAL NUMBER ANALYSIS REPORT

28:45.849 --> 28:47.142
Who is Song Joonsu?

28:54.649 --> 28:56.317
We got the firearm analysis back.

28:57.235 --> 28:58.945
I confirmed with the Administration.

29:03.533 --> 29:05.076
You pick it up?

29:06.244 --> 29:09.164
The gun was issued
to Corporal Song Joonsu in '04.

29:10.290 --> 29:12.250
Records show he was with Narcotics.

29:13.752 --> 29:14.753
Who is he?

29:22.135 --> 29:23.720
He was one of my guys.

29:25.054 --> 29:27.515
He died shortly after joining Narcotics.

29:29.893 --> 29:31.519
Was Dongcheon involved?

29:36.775 --> 29:38.193
Dongcheon killed him.

29:47.744 --> 29:49.412
Is this the report?

29:49.496 --> 29:50.955
NAME: SONG JOONSU
SERIAL: GL86575

29:51.539 --> 29:53.416
So the gun was from Narcotics.

29:53.500 --> 29:55.752
DIED DURING OPERATION,
GUN WAS NOT RECOVERED

29:55.835 --> 29:59.047
SUPERVISOR IN CHARGE
NARCOTICS TEAM 1, LIEUTENANT CHA GIHO

30:30.161 --> 30:32.247
Did Dongcheon kill a cop in the past?

30:34.415 --> 30:36.918
The gun belonged to a cop
who died long ago.

30:37.544 --> 30:40.380
Cha Giho says that cop was murdered
while following Dongcheon…

30:40.463 --> 30:41.548
Didn't happen.

30:42.715 --> 30:44.467
We do not kill cops.

30:45.969 --> 30:48.221
Cha Giho has been chasing me for ages.

30:48.304 --> 30:50.390
He crossed the line years ago.

30:51.099 --> 30:53.434
He appeased, deceived,
and entrapped us.

30:53.518 --> 30:55.103
He did anything he could.

30:56.688 --> 30:58.565
And now that the gun has surfaced,

30:59.649 --> 31:01.484
he's starting to play dirty.

31:03.653 --> 31:04.821
Don't buy it.

31:14.163 --> 31:15.832
I'm telling the truth.

31:16.374 --> 31:18.376
The cops took all of it.

31:24.883 --> 31:25.967
You know…

31:26.050 --> 31:27.218
Huh?

31:27.302 --> 31:28.428
…there aren't…

31:28.511 --> 31:31.180
…very many people…

31:31.723 --> 31:35.351
…in this world that I like.

31:36.185 --> 31:37.395
Especially…

31:39.647 --> 31:42.609
can't stand assholes that lie.

31:44.485 --> 31:47.530
But who in this line of work doesn't lie?

31:47.614 --> 31:49.782
It's a world of villains.

31:53.411 --> 31:55.997
Listen, if you're gonna lie to me…

31:56.080 --> 31:57.165
Here.

31:57.248 --> 31:59.208
- Put more thought into it.
- That's not it, Gangjae…

32:04.380 --> 32:06.716
You need to show sincerity.

32:13.765 --> 32:14.933
SONG JOONSU DEATH REPORT

32:15.016 --> 32:17.060
HE WAS A CIVIL SERVANT.
WHILE TRACKING THE ROUTE OF

32:17.143 --> 32:20.104
DONGCHEON'S NEW DRUG,
HE FOUND AN IMPORTANT CLUE

32:20.188 --> 32:22.190
TO CHOI MUJIN.
AND DURING INVESTIGATION…

32:23.066 --> 32:24.233
What does it say?

32:24.984 --> 32:26.069
- Hey.
- Hmm.

32:26.152 --> 32:27.820
Gangjae's and Mango's are the same.

32:27.904 --> 32:29.447
- LSD?
- Yeah.

32:29.530 --> 32:30.782
Oh, jeez.

32:30.865 --> 32:32.325
Hold on.

32:34.994 --> 32:36.120
Captain.

32:36.788 --> 32:37.956
On my desk.

32:40.833 --> 32:42.001
Detective Oh.

32:43.336 --> 32:44.671
What are you doing later?

32:47.090 --> 32:48.216
Why?

32:49.092 --> 32:50.510
Wanna grab soju?

32:54.138 --> 32:55.515
I have plans.

32:56.599 --> 32:58.643
Okay. See you.

33:07.568 --> 33:09.696
"Wanna grab some soju with me?"

33:09.779 --> 33:12.240
Rejected!

33:12.323 --> 33:14.742
- She's not easy.
- She's not. God, loser.

33:14.826 --> 33:16.911
Wait! Buy me a soju!

33:17.495 --> 33:18.579
Gunpyeong.

33:18.663 --> 33:21.290
"Wanna get some liquor?"

33:40.768 --> 33:43.062
Have you heard of Do Gangjae or this drug?

34:59.931 --> 35:01.140
What are you doing here?

35:02.600 --> 35:04.602
Pildo, what are you doing here?

35:04.685 --> 35:05.686
Answer me.

35:09.732 --> 35:11.901
- I was watching Mango.
- Why?

35:11.984 --> 35:14.070
The drugs left in the gym
was the same ones

35:14.153 --> 35:15.446
that Mango was carrying with him.

35:15.530 --> 35:16.614
I know that.

35:18.783 --> 35:21.077
I'm asking why you're investigating alone.

35:22.954 --> 35:24.872
Because dangerous assholes have a new drug

35:24.956 --> 35:26.666
and no one is investigating.

35:29.710 --> 35:30.837
Is that all?

35:50.273 --> 35:51.774
I'm going to find Gangjae.

35:53.693 --> 35:56.320
Act on your own again,
and I'll make you regret it.

35:56.904 --> 35:58.030
Drive.

36:16.007 --> 36:17.216
Have a good night.

36:17.300 --> 36:19.302
- Thank you.
- Come again.

36:24.974 --> 36:26.350
Welcome back.

36:35.610 --> 36:37.904
- You're coming often lately.
- Yes.

36:37.987 --> 36:40.031
- Spicy fish stew and soju?
- Yes, please.

36:40.114 --> 36:41.032
Okay.

36:51.918 --> 36:52.919
Yes?

36:56.505 --> 36:57.465
It's 261.

36:58.090 --> 36:59.175
Beomya-ro.

37:11.437 --> 37:12.605
Okay. Thanks.

37:16.275 --> 37:18.277
It's a factory that shut down last month.

38:12.581 --> 38:14.375
Tailing a druggie on a Friday?

38:15.209 --> 38:17.336
Why are you working so hard on this?

38:17.920 --> 38:19.630
You got no friends?

38:19.714 --> 38:21.966
Well, I don't see you
surrounded by friends.

38:28.723 --> 38:30.182
You're doing this…

38:31.100 --> 38:32.351
because of your dad, right?

38:38.941 --> 38:39.942
Welcome.

38:42.028 --> 38:43.738
Uh, I forgot my cigarettes.

38:44.322 --> 38:45.197
Hm.

38:45.698 --> 38:47.700
Would you go and buy me a pack, please?

38:51.871 --> 38:52.913
Please, ma'am.

39:11.640 --> 39:14.685
Your dad was an addict, wasn't he?

39:16.604 --> 39:18.564
He was high when he was in that accident.

39:20.775 --> 39:22.485
You're looking for someone, right?

39:23.944 --> 39:25.196
Who is it?

40:18.124 --> 40:19.583
He gave it to him for free?

40:24.713 --> 40:26.549
I don't see any of his minions.

41:28.027 --> 41:29.528
Argh!

42:36.595 --> 42:37.930
Where's Do Gangjae?

42:40.599 --> 42:42.226
Where's Do Gangjae?

43:02.204 --> 43:04.039
A fortune-teller told me…

43:04.540 --> 43:10.379
this would be a lucky year for me.

43:10.462 --> 43:12.047
This is from our security camera.

43:12.131 --> 43:13.757
She suddenly showed up,

43:13.841 --> 43:16.552
beat up all my guys,
and took all the drugs.

43:16.635 --> 43:18.929
That fucking narc.

43:19.013 --> 43:20.639
Stop whining about some narc.

43:20.723 --> 43:22.016
Shut the fuck up.

43:22.099 --> 43:26.562
What? What? Show me.

43:27.271 --> 43:28.772
Hey!

43:28.856 --> 43:30.691
It's the fucking bitch!

43:36.822 --> 43:37.823
Bang.

43:46.123 --> 43:47.541
Oh Hyejin.

43:52.212 --> 43:55.049
Oh Hyejin the detective.

44:02.598 --> 44:04.183
Lovely to see you,

44:05.559 --> 44:07.436
you fucking bitch.
